  "note": "Round 34, for Nautilus on the CPU census. Seven of the QAT-unquantized copies rounds 32 and 33 left for room and the first DiffusionGemma copy since round 30. llmfan46's 26B-A4B is the third copy on the 26B-A4B QAT original after mewse and OS-Software in round 32. wnfldchen's, smashingtags's and coder3101's 12B copies are the third to fifth on the 12B QAT original after huihui-ai and igorls; smashingtags's live card names the QAT checkpoint. eadx's 26B-A4B is marked as duplicated from huihui-ai's 26B-A4B QAT abliteration with weight files of its own, so the pinner admitted it. prithivMLmods's E4B is the first copy on the E4B QAT original. xdavxd's 26B-A4B is pinned against the QAT checkpoint its name cites. Umranz's DiffusionGemma abliteration is the fourth edit of the diffusion variant, readable since round 30. The pinner refused liskasYR/gemma-4-12B-it-qat-q4_0-unquantized-heretic, whose weight files equal igorls's 12B QAT heretic pinned in round 33. Kooten/gemma-4-31b-abliterated-v1.1 pinned against google/gemma-4-31B-it and its 189 renamed vision-tower names now pair across the linear wrapper, but the rehearsal stub seeds each tensor from the length of its name under its prefixes and not under the wrapper, so the stub copy read 189 changed tower tensors beyond the planted writers and the rehearsal failed; the pair waits for the stub to seed by the mapped name. Held, as in round 33. tvall43/gemma-4-E2B-it-heretic-v1 drops 160 vision-tower weights and adds 32 input_max tensors. The Ministral 3 Instruct heretic and abliterated exports (nchapman, s3nh, hrktos-37, 0utsideness, realoperator42) stand on float8 originals, as do the Mistral Small 4 and Devstral 2 copies. coder3101's Mistral Small 3.2 heretic keeps several checkpoints under one name. grimjim's 8bit abliterations and the nf4, w4a16, NVFP4, 6bit and oQ4e exports are quantised copies. The Gemma 2, Gemma 3 and MedGemma copies wait on gated originals. llmfan46's Garnet, Gembrain, Harmonia, Queen and Ortenzya 31B copies and its composer 12B copies declare a fine-tune as their base. lhca521 and tutuchen2000 Huihui 26B-A4B re-uploads stay untried after two of that edit's re-uploads were refused. Left for room, untried. DuoNeural's DiffusionGemma copy. Dzluck's E2B v2. enkato64bit's SuperGemma 12B. The QAT copies on other sizes (coder3101 and igorls E4B, llmfan46 and coder3101 31B, coder3101 26B-A4B, wnfldchen 31B merged, eadx E4B and E2B Huihui re-uploads). The OS-Software, JJaguar and Mitchins copies named after a QAT checkpoint whose cards declare the instruct model."
